 SetCell 4 4 0 'Operator computer'
 SetCell 4 4 1 'Browser-capable computer'
 SetCell 4 4 2 'Camera-capable computer'
 SetCell 4 4 3 'Used for browser-based member and administrative workflows; no hardware performance threshold has been established.'
 SetCell 4 5 1 'Browser-capable computer'
 SetCell 4 5 2 'Computer with supported camera'
 SetCell 4 5 3 'Supports counter entry and QR attendance; dedicated POS hardware is not required.'
 SetCell 4 7 1 'Currently supported OS'
 SetCell 4 7 2 'Currently supported OS with security updates'
 SetCell 4 7 3 'Use an operating system and browser that still receive vendor security updates; Windows 10 Home and Pro are no longer in general support.'
 SetCell 4 8 1 'Supported camera-enabled device'
 SetCell 4 8 2 'Camera with clear focus and current browser support'
 SetCell 4 8 3 'Camera access requires browser permission and a secure browser context. Phone attendance also requires an administrator-managed pairing.'
 SetCell 4 9 1 'Internet access'
